    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that order with or without modification), no window(s)/door(s) shall be installed in the side elevations of the development hereby permitted without the prior permission in writing of the local planning authority.",
